<edge id="milton-trump47-donation-pardon" source="n172" target="n0"><data key="e_n">197</data><data key="e_id">milton-trump47-donation-pardon</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (Trump 47 Committee) ... pardon (sequence)</data><data key="e_category">pardon/settlement</data><data key="e_label">$920K then pardon</data><data key="e_date">2024-10-10 ; 2025-03-27</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">True</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-09 (v9)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-09</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-09-powermap-v9-V-milton-trump47-donation-pardon</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://docquery.fec.gov/cgi-bin/forms/C00042622/1851953/sa/12 ; https://www.cnbc.com/2025/03/28/trump-pardons-nikola-trevor-milton-ceo-securities-fraud-electric-vehicle.html ; https://www.cbsnews.com/news/rfk-jr-lee-zeldin-democrats-congress-trump-pardons/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE, sequence only: FEC shows Trevor Milton gave $920,000 to the Trump 47 Committee on Oct 10 2024 (wife Chelsey $10,000 Oct 17); Trump fully pardoned Milton's 2022 securities-fraud conviction on Mar 27 2025 (CNBC). CBS (Oct 9 2026) puts the couple's pro-Trump giving near $2M. Order of events only; no document ties the money to the pardon. Democrats wrote Oct 6 2026 asking who advocated for it.</data></edge>
