<edge id="grenell-mildon-kennedy-center-gift" source="n191" target="n190"><data key="e_n">219</data><data key="e_id">grenell-mildon-kennedy-center-gift</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">donation solicitation + business payment (SAID by Habba; unproven)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">gift routed? (SAID, unproven)</data><data key="e_date">2025 spring (alleged) ; 2026-10-09 accusation</data><data key="e_grade">I</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">pending</data><data key="e_status_date">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-14 (v12)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-21</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-14-powermap-v12-I-grenell-mildon-kennedy-center-gift</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">4</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.axios.com/2026/10/14/trump-kennedy-center-donation-maga-feud ; https://nypost.com/2026/10/14/us-news/alina-habba-accuses-ric-grenell-of-failing-to-deposit-millions-donated-by-her-husband-to-the-kennedy-center/ ; https://www.telegraph.co.uk/us/news/2026/10/14/white-house-kennedy-centre-missing-1m/ ; https://www.thedailybeast.com/maga-blood-feud-exposed-in-kennedy-center-cash-scandal</data><data key="e_claim">SAID, partly supported: Habba told Trump and WH staff (Oval, Oct 9 2026) that in spring 2025 Grenell persuaded Mildon to fold a multimillion-dollar Kennedy Center gift (first $17M, later $5.6M) into a $17.6M lump-sum payment for a business deal with a US company, and the gift was never deposited (Axios, four senior officials; NY Post; Telegraph). DONE side: Kennedy Center books show only a $270K Mildon pledge, which he paid Oct 13 2026; staff searched for a ~$6M gift late 2025 and found none; WH Counsel Scharf asked for documents and had none. Grenell: 'Absurd.' Daily Beast: the two are friends with Venezuela interests. Register: grokbot-2026-10-14-I-axios-habba-grenell-kennedy-center.</data></edge>
<edge id="crew-v-kushner-envoy-2026" source="n192" target="n36"><data key="e_n">220</data><data key="e_id">crew-v-kushner-envoy-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">lawsuit (Appointments Clause + Ethics Act; D.D.C. 26-cv-3580)</data><data key="e_category">appointment</data><data key="e_label">sued: unconfirmed envoy (10-14)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-14</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">pending</data><data key="e_status_date">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-14 (v12)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-14-powermap-v12-V-crew-v-kushner-envoy-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">4</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.citizensforethics.org/legal-action/lawsuits/crew-sues-to-block-jared-kushner-from-acting-as-trump-envoy/ ; https://assets.bwbx.io/documents/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/rv7jGS_EmY1Y/v0 ; https://apnews.com/article/jared-kushner-crew-lawsuit-trump-envoy-diplomat-aa28eeb278937ec29c0f35e72d13ba45 ; https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/trump-administration/watchdog-group-sues-trump-administration-jared-kushners-government-wor-rcna603563</data><data key="e_claim">DONE lawsuit: CREW filed suit Oct 14 2026 (Case No. 26-cv-3580) to block Jared Kushner from acting as a top US diplomat without Senate confirmation and to compel Ethics Act financial disclosures; the complaint says he works with Special Envoy Witkoff, has filed no second-term disclosure and has overlapping business interests (CREW release; complaint PDF; AP; NBC). Merits pending. Register: grokbot-2026-10-14-V-crew-sues-jared-kushner-unconfirmed-diplomat.</data></edge>
<edge id="adl-frontier-labs-said" source="n193" target="n194"><data key="e_n">221</data><data key="e_id">adl-frontier-labs-said</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">working relationship (SAID by Greenblatt)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">'working with' labs (SAID)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-13 statement</data><data key="e_grade">I</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-14 (v12)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-14</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-14-powermap-v12-I-adl-frontier-labs-said</data><data key="e_source_tier">social</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://x.com/infolibnews/status/2110091224627441737</data><data key="e_claim">SAID: ADL CEO Jonathan Greenblatt, speaking in Israel (clip relayed Oct 13 2026), said 'We've been working with the Frontier Labs: OpenAI, Anthropic, Alphabet/Google (Gemini), Meta...' on antisemitism in AI outputs. The clip is truncated; what any lab changed is not documented. Kept as SAID, not a DONE tie. Register: grokbot-2026-10-14-V-greenblatt-adl-frontier-labs.</data></edge>
<edge id="rabbis-smotrich-bengvir-joint-2025" source="n195" target="n196"><data key="e_n">222</data><data key="e_id">rabbis-smotrich-bengvir-joint-2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">endorsement / consultation meeting (joint statement)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">rabbis back ministers (Jul 2025)</data><data key="e_date">2025-07-31</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-rabbis-smotrich-bengvir-joint-2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.ynetnews.com/article/ehlzwlwz6 ; https://hm-news.co.il/572327/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE meeting+endorsement: Religious Zionist rabbis met Ministers Itamar Ben Gvir and Bezalel Smotrich and issued a joint statement backing their unified front against a hostage deal leaving captives with Hamas and against humanitarian aid, demanding complete victory over Hamas (Ynet, Shilo Freid; Hebrew corroboration hm-news Jul 31 2025). Signatories include Dov Lior, Eitan Eisman, Elyakim Levanon, Shmuel Eliyahu, David Hai Hacohen, David Turgeman. Endorsement/consultation only — not causation of later policy.</data></edge>
<edge id="smotrich-consults-rabbis-five" source="n197" target="n199"><data key="e_n">223</data><data key="e_id">smotrich-consults-rabbis-five</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">consultation (SAID by Smotrich)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">consults 'the Five' rabbis [SAID]</data><data key="e_date">2025-03 (NPR cites prior video)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-smotrich-consults-rabbis-five</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.npr.org/2025/03/21/nx-s1-5323006/the-rise-of-israels-finance-minister-bezalel-smotrich</data><data key="e_claim">SAID consultation (Smotrich's own words on video, reported by NPR Mar 21 2025): 'I struggled with this decision and gathered my rabbis to consult with them. After all, I want to influence the war.' NPR says he regularly consults a group known as the Five, including Rabbi Yehoshua Shapira (Ramat Gan). Page opened 2026-10-15 (prior UNVERIFIED correction cleared). Consultation claim only — not that rabbis caused any named policy act.</data></edge>
<edge id="shmuel-eliyahu-amichai-eliyahu-family" source="n200" target="n201"><data key="e_n">224</data><data key="e_id">shmuel-eliyahu-amichai-eliyahu-family</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">family (father/son) + cabinet appointment</data><data key="e_category">appointment</data><data key="e_label">father (Safed rabbi) / son (Heritage Min.)</data><data key="e_date">ongoing; Amichai Heritage Minister from 2022; nuke remark 2023-11-05</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-shmuel-eliyahu-amichai-eliyahu-family</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.timesofisrael.com/far-right-minister-says-nuking-gaza-an-option-pm-suspends-him-from-cabinet-meetings/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE family+office: Heritage Minister Amichai Eliyahu is the son of Rabbi Shmuel Eliyahu (Safed chief rabbi) and grandson of former Chief Rabbi Mordechai Eliyahu (Times of Israel Nov 5 2023). On Radio Kol Berama he SAID a nuclear bomb on Gaza was 'one way' (Netanyahu suspended him from cabinet meetings). Family/appointment tie only; the nuke remark is SAID, not a DONE policy order.</data></edge>
<edge id="rubio-huckabee-netanyahu-elad-pilgrimage" source="n105" target="n202"><data key="e_n">225</data><data key="e_id">rubio-huckabee-netanyahu-elad-pilgrimage</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">joint inauguration (Pilgrimage Road / City of David)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">Pilgrimage Road inauguration</data><data key="e_date">2025-09-15</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-rubio-huckabee-netanyahu-elad-pilgrimage</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.jpost.com/israel-news/benjamin-netanyahu/article-867585 ; https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cg42v2r10kyo</data><data key="e_claim">DONE joint inauguration: Secretary of State Marco Rubio, PM Benjamin Netanyahu and Ambassador Mike Huckabee inaugurated the fully excavated Pilgrimage Road at the City of David (Elad-operated) in East Jerusalem on Sep 15/16 2025 (Jerusalem Post; BBC). Appearance/backing of the site only — not a claim that the visit caused later settlement policy.</data></edge>
<edge id="johnson-huckabee-ariel-visit-2025" source="n203" target="n185"><data key="e_n">226</data><data key="e_id">johnson-huckabee-ariel-visit-2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">joint visit (West Bank settlement Ariel)</data><data key="e_category">pardon/settlement</data><data key="e_label">Ariel settlement visit</data><data key="e_date">2025-08-04</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-johnson-huckabee-ariel-visit-2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.timesofisrael.com/us-speaker-johnson-makes-landmark-visit-to-west-bank-settlement-of-ariel/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE joint visit: Speaker Mike Johnson, with Ambassador Mike Huckabee (and Sarah Huckabee Sanders), visited the West Bank settlement of Ariel on Aug 4 2025 — highest-ranking US official ever to visit a settlement per ToI. Johnson SAID Judea and Samaria belong to the Jewish people by right. Visit/endorsement language only.</data></edge>
<edge id="johnson-netanyahu-shiloh-dinner-2025" source="n203" target="n119"><data key="e_n">227</data><data key="e_id">johnson-netanyahu-shiloh-dinner-2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">meeting / dinner (Shiloh settlement)</data><data key="e_category">pardon/settlement</data><data key="e_label">Shiloh dinner with Netanyahu</data><data key="e_date">2025-08-04</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-johnson-netanyahu-shiloh-dinner-2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.ynetnews.com/article/0b6i9zy87 ; https://www.jns.org/israel-news/netanyahu-johnson-meet-in-ancient-shiloh-along-with-congress-members</data><data key="e_claim">DONE meeting: Same day as the Ariel visit, PM Netanyahu and Sara hosted Speaker Mike Johnson and Kelly Lary for a meal in the West Bank settlement of Shiloh, with Ambassador Mike Huckabee and several Republican members of Congress (Ynet; ToI/JNS corroboration). Meeting only — not a claim of a specific deal made at dinner.</data></edge>
<edge id="errol-musk-netanyahu-family-friend" source="n204" target="n119"><data key="e_n">228</data><data key="e_id">errol-musk-netanyahu-family-friend</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">claimed family friendship (SAID by Errol Musk)</data><data key="e_category">family</data><data key="e_label">family friend [SAID by Errol]</data><data key="e_date">2025-02 (~interview); Elon-Netanyahu meeting 2023-09-18 is separate DONE</data><data key="e_grade">I</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-I-errol-musk-netanyahu-family-friend</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.reddit.com/r/LateStageCapitalism/comments/1jxgl18/ ; https://www.nytimes.com/2023/09/18/world/middleeast/netanyahu-musk-meeting.html</data><data key="e_claim">SAID only (Errol Musk interview ~Feb 12 2025, seen via Reddit/Rumble re-uploads): Netanyahu is a 'family friend'; also that Netanyahu called Elon de facto president (the latter traces to the Sep 18 2023 Tesla livestream, NYT/JTA — separate DONE meeting). No primary interview transcript or documented family-to-family relationship found. Keep I/SAID; do not promote to DONE.</data></edge>
<edge id="smotrich-bessent-treasury-2025" source="n197" target="n3"><data key="e_n">229</data><data key="e_id">smotrich-bessent-treasury-2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">official meeting (Treasury)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">Bessent-Smotrich Treasury meet</data><data key="e_date">2025-03-05</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-smotrich-bessent-treasury-2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sb0043 ; https://home.treasury.gov/system/files/136/SB-March-2025.pdf ; https://www.nytimes.com/2025/03/05/world/middleeast/smotrich-bessent-us-israel.html</data><data key="e_claim">DONE official meeting: Treasury press release SB0043 — Secretary Bessent and Israeli Finance Minister Bezalel Smotrich met in Washington Mar 5 2025 and agreed to strengthen dialogue on economic policy, technology and financial regulation (home.treasury.gov; Bessent calendar 9:00-9:45am; NYT). US-access tie on the rabbi→minister→US chain. Meeting only — not causation of later OFAC/aid decisions.</data></edge>
<edge id="bengvir-gop-congress-maralago-2025" source="n198" target="n205"><data key="e_n">230</data><data key="e_id">bengvir-gop-congress-maralago-2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">meeting (Mar-a-Lago dinner + Capitol Hill)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">Mar-a-Lago + Capitol Hill meetings</data><data key="e_date">2025-04-22 ; 2025-04-28</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-bengvir-gop-congress-maralago-2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.jta.org/2025/04/28/israel/ben-gvir-says-he-met-with-4-members-of-congress-rebuffed-protesters-at-us-capitol ; https://www.timesofisrael.com/ben-gvir-meets-4-gop-lawmakers-on-capitol-hill-expanding-inroads-in-us-politics/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE meetings (Ben Gvir office via JTA/ToI): on first official US trip Apr 2025, Ben Gvir had dinner at Mar-a-Lago Apr 22 with House Majority Whip Tom Emmer (Trump absent) and on Apr 28 met Reps Brian Mast (HFAC chair), Jim Jordan, Claudia Tenney, Mike Lawler on Capitol Hill. No Trump administration officials met him. US-access tie; not a claim those meetings caused named US policy.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-bailey-ola-director" source="n0" target="n206"><data key="e_n">231</data><data key="e_id">trump-bailey-ola-director</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">appointment (WH Office of Legislative Affairs director)</data><data key="e_category">appointment</data><data key="e_label">OLA director (Oct 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-10</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-trump-bailey-ola-director</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/katie-bailey-new-head-of-white-house-office-of-legislative-affairs-sources/ ; https://thehill.com/homenews/administration/6141177-trump-names-katie-bailey-legislative-director/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE appointment: President Trump named Katie Bailey Director of the White House Office of Legislative Affairs on or about Oct 10-11 2026, replacing James Braid (CBS News Oct 10; Trump Truth Social confirmation reported by CBS/The Hill). She had been deputy director / special assistant. Appointment only.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-sonderling-labor-secretary" source="n0" target="n207"><data key="e_n">232</data><data key="e_id">trump-sonderling-labor-secretary</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">appointment / Senate confirmation (Secretary of Labor)</data><data key="e_category">appointment</data><data key="e_label">Labor Secretary (confirmed Sep 30)</data><data key="e_date">2026-09-30 confirmed; sworn 2026-10-02</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-15 (v13)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-15</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-15-powermap-v13-V-trump-sonderling-labor-secretary</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.senate.gov/legislative/LIS/roll_call_votes/vote1192/vote_119_2_00256.htm ; https://www.dol.gov/agencies/osec/keith-sonderling</data><data key="e_claim">DONE confirmation: Senate confirmed Keith Sonderling as Secretary of Labor Sep 30 2026 by 47-41 (roll call 256, PN1129); sworn Oct 2 2026 (Senate.gov; DOL). Had been Acting Secretary since Apr 2026. Appointment only.</data></edge>
<edge id="susie-wiles-katie-wiles-family" source="n208" target="n209"><data key="e_n">233</data><data key="e_id">susie-wiles-katie-wiles-family</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">family (mother / daughter)</data><data key="e_category">family</data><data key="e_label">mother/daughter</data><data key="e_date">ongoing (reported 2026-10)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-susie-wiles-katie-wiles-family</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/ ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE family tie: Katie Wiles is the daughter of White House chief of staff Susie Wiles (CBS Oct 8 2026; NYT Oct 15 2026). White House official: Susie Wiles does not discuss work matters with her daughters (SAID). Family tie only.</data></edge>
<edge id="katie-wiles-continental-strategy-partner" source="n209" target="n210"><data key="e_n">234</data><data key="e_id">katie-wiles-continental-strategy-partner</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">employment (partner)</data><data key="e_category">employment</data><data key="e_label">partner</data><data key="e_date">as of 2026-10 (firm website)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-katie-wiles-continental-strategy-partner</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/ ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE employment: Katie Wiles is a partner at Continental Strategy per the firm's website (CBS); NYT says Continental counts several former Trump campaign/administration officials among its partners plus Katie Wiles. Firm SAID she does not lobby the US government for any client and has not spoken with any US official about Srpska.</data></edge>
<edge id="srpska-continental-strategy-fara-35k" source="n211" target="n210"><data key="e_n">235</data><data key="e_id">srpska-continental-strategy-fara-35k</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (FARA lobbying retainer, $35K/month)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$35K/mo FARA (2026-02-)</data><data key="e_date">2026-02 onward</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-srpska-continental-strategy-fara-35k</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/ ; https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE money flow: per Justice Department FARA filings (NYT), Republika Srpska began paying Continental Strategy $35,000 a month in February 2026; CBS reviewed FARA filings showing Continental registered for Srpska in early 2026, with Alejandro (Alex) Garcia signing as consultant. Lobbying retainer only; no claim it bought a named US decision.</data></edge>
<edge id="susie-wiles-cvijanovic-wh-meeting-2026" source="n208" target="n212"><data key="e_n">236</data><data key="e_id">susie-wiles-cvijanovic-wh-meeting-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">meeting (White House; arranged by Continental's Alex Garcia)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">WH meeting (Sep 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-09</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-susie-wiles-cvijanovic-wh-meeting-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/ ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE meeting: WH chief of staff Susie Wiles met Zeljka Cvijanovic, a close Dodik ally, at the White House in September 2026; a White House official told CBS the meeting was arranged by Continental partner Alex Garcia, not by Katie Wiles (SAID). The Srpska official posted photos ('building new and strengthening old friendships', NYT). Sequence with the Continental retainer; no causation claimed.</data></edge>
<edge id="srpska-blair-lacivita-paid-2026" source="n211" target="n213"><data key="e_n">237</data><data key="e_id">srpska-blair-lacivita-paid-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (paid election consulting via Boies Schiller Flexner; hundreds of thousands $ each)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">paid via Boies Schiller (Oct 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10 (trip before Oct 4 vote; reported 2026-10-06)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-srpska-blair-lacivita-paid-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cnn.com/2026/10/07/politics/trump-fire-james-blair-chris-lacivita ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: Blair and LaCivita travelled to Republika Srpska before its Oct 4 2026 elections and were paid hundreds of thousands of dollars each through Boies Schiller Flexner, a law firm retained by the Srpska government (NYT Oct 6, via CNN; NYT Oct 15). Dodik's party won and he thanked Trump and Putin. SAID Trump (Truth Social Oct 7): they are outside consultants; 'if there's a conflict, I will terminate them, immediately!' — later 'They don't have a conflict'. No termination as of Oct 16.</data></edge>
<edge id="flynn-srpska-fara-lobbyist-oct2025" source="n214" target="n211"><data key="e_n">238</data><data key="e_id">flynn-srpska-fara-lobbyist-oct2025</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">employment (paid FARA-registered lobbyist)</data><data key="e_category">employment</data><data key="e_label">FARA lobbyist (Oct 2025)</data><data key="e_date">2025-10</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-flynn-srpska-fara-lobbyist-oct2025</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/ ; https://ofac.treasury.gov/recent-actions/20251029</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: FARA filings cited in a House Democratic report and reviewed by CBS show Michael Flynn worked as a paid lobbyist for Republika Srpska in October 2025 — the month OFAC lifted the Dodik sanctions (Oct 29 2025, OFAC recent action). The two facts are a sequence; no causal link is claimed by this edge.</data></edge>
<edge id="srpska-delisting-aafs-pipeline-sequence" source="n211" target="n215"><data key="e_n">239</data><data key="e_id">srpska-delisting-aafs-pipeline-sequence</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">sequence: OFAC sanctions delisting (2025-10-29) ... AAFS named lead pipeline developer</data><data key="e_category">pardon/settlement</data><data key="e_label">delisting ... pipeline lead (seq)</data><data key="e_date">2025-10-29 delisting ; by ~2026-04 lead-developer law</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">True</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-srpska-delisting-aafs-pipeline-sequence</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://ofac.treasury.gov/recent-actions/20251029 ; https://www.rferl.org/a/us-pro-russian-bosnian-serb-dodik-sanctions-list/33576314.html ; https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/</data><data key="e_claim">Sequence only. A: OFAC removed Dodik and 47 others (family, allies, companies) from the SDN list Oct 29 2025 (OFAC recent action; RFE/RL). B: within six months Dodik's party dropped its opposition and Bosnia's parliament passed legislation naming AAFS (Binnall / Joseph Flynn) lead developer of the Bosnia-Croatia gas pipeline (CBS, citing a House Democratic report). House Democrats allege the delisting enriched Trump allies; White House says it prevented Balkan instability (SAID). Two documented facts in time order; this edge claims no cause.</data></edge>
<edge id="trumpjr-america-first-refining-stake" source="n38" target="n216"><data key="e_n">240</data><data key="e_id">trumpjr-america-first-refining-stake</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">ownership (minority stake via TX Fuels LLC)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">minority stake (2025-)</data><data key="e_date">2025 (TX Fuels LLC registered 2025-06) ; reported 2026-06-09</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-trumpjr-america-first-refining-stake</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.propublica.org/article/trump-ambani-reliance-industries-america-first-refining-texas ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE ownership: Donald Trump Jr. secretly acquired a stake in America First Refining via a Wyoming LLC (TX Fuels) registered at his Jupiter FL address (ProPublica Jun 9 2026, records + seven people); his spokesperson SAID he is 'simply a passive minority investor'. NYT Oct 15: AFR shares an address with TXC Energy, whose CEO Calce Katie Wiles escorted to Srpska. Trump personally announced Reliance's AFR investment on Truth Social (Mar 2026). Size of stake undisclosed.</data></edge>
<edge id="afr-continental-strategy-lobbying-750k" source="n216" target="n210"><data key="e_n">241</data><data key="e_id">afr-continental-strategy-lobbying-750k</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (lobbying fees $750K; WH + Energy Dept)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$750K lobbying</data><data key="e_date">2025-2026 (lobbying records; reported 2026-10-15)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-afr-continental-strategy-lobbying-750k</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE money flow: America First Refining and a predecessor company have paid Continental Strategy $750,000 to lobby the White House and the Energy Department on the Brownsville refinery and 'energy and industrial development', per lobbying records (NYT Oct 15 2026). Alex Garcia, not Katie Wiles, is the listed lobbyist on the account. Closes a loop: Don Jr.'s portfolio company pays the firm where the chief of staff's daughter is a partner.</data></edge>
<edge id="cantor-america-first-refining-adviser" source="n69" target="n216"><data key="e_n">242</data><data key="e_id">cantor-america-first-refining-adviser</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">business (Cantor = AFR adviser on nine-figure Reliance raise)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">AFR adviser (2026-03)</data><data key="e_date">2026-03</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-cantor-america-first-refining-adviser</data><data key="e_source_tier">reference</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.propublica.org/article/trump-ambani-reliance-industries-america-first-refining-texas</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: Cantor Fitzgerald — run by Commerce Secretary Lutnick's sons since he joined the cabinet — announced it is financial adviser to America First Refining, including on the Ambani/Reliance nine-figure investment (ProPublica Jun 9 2026, citing Cantor's announcement; Cantor declined comment). Same company Don Jr. holds a stake in.</data></edge>
<edge id="katie-wiles-calce-srpska-trip-2026" source="n209" target="n216"><data key="e_n">243</data><data key="e_id">katie-wiles-calce-srpska-trip-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">contact (accompanied Calce to Srpska; comms client)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">Srpska trip w/ Calce [I]</data><data key="e_date">2026-08 (mid-Aug, two days)</data><data key="e_grade">I</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-I-katie-wiles-calce-srpska-trip-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cbsnews.com/news/russia-trump-susie-wiles-milorad-dodik-bosnia-serbia/ ; https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/15/more-trump-allies-aided-pro-russian-balkan-government/</data><data key="e_claim">BOTH, partly supported: Katie Wiles went to Republika Srpska for two days in mid-Aug 2026 (CBS verified photo with interior minister Zeljko Budimir; Continental SAID the trip was strategic-comms support for a US company she has served for over two years). NYT names that company as TXC Energy (John V. Calce), exploring a Croatia-Srpska gas pipeline with the Srpska government, on three unnamed people. Trip is DONE; the client identity rests on anonymous sourcing.</data></edge>
<edge id="andriesz-bgc-lutnick-whistleblower" source="n217" target="n2"><data key="e_n">244</data><data key="e_id">andriesz-bgc-lutnick-whistleblower</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">employment (ex-senior employee, BGC Partners) + whistleblower reports</data><data key="e_category">employment</data><data key="e_label">ex-BGC whistleblower</data><data key="e_date">ex-BGC (dates not given) ; FCA/FBI reports 2018-2026 ; d. 2026-09-23</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-andriesz-bgc-lutnick-whistleblower</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwm2686gl6kno</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: Andriesz was a former senior employee of BGC Partners, the firm Lutnick founded and ran; in 2026 he raised evidence of Epstein-Lutnick business links with the FCA, FBI and other watchdogs (BBC Oct 6 2026). SAID (his evidence): Lutnick in 2013 offered Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor a JV for a GBP1m loan; BGC says the JV did not go ahead. He died in Thailand Sep 23 2026; his family says he took his own life with no suggestion of foul play; FCA board member Lea Paterson is reviewing the FCA's handling. Employment + reporting tie; the death is a later fact in sequence, no causation claimed.</data></edge>
<edge id="grenell-tx-at-consulting-2024" source="n191" target="n218"><data key="e_n">245</data><data key="e_id">grenell-tx-at-consulting-2024</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">employment (consultant 2024; SAID by Grenell)</data><data key="e_category">employment</data><data key="e_label">consulted 2024 (SAID)</data><data key="e_date">2024 (consulting) ; 2025-05 alleged Mildon wire</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-16 (v14)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-16</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-16-powermap-v14-V-grenell-tx-at-consulting-2024</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://dnyuz.com/2026/10/16/behind-a-white-house-feud-that-is-bitter-even-by-trump-era-standards/</data><data key="e_claim">SAID by Grenell (NYT Oct 16 2026): he consulted for TX-AT in 2024 but had no connection to the company when Mildon says he made the transfer, and never solicited payments for it. Separately (I, SAID by Habba): Mildon wired $17.6M in May 2025 to TX-AT at Grenell's direction, $5.6M meant for the Kennedy Center; Mildon's lawyer sent WH Counsel Scharf a wire receipt and texts; NYT has not verified them; Grenell denies. Consulting tie held as Grenell's own SAID; the wire allegation stays I.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-musk-national-medal-science-2026" source="n0" target="n32"><data key="e_n">246</data><data key="e_id">trump-musk-national-medal-science-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">honor (National Medal of Science, presented by the President)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">Nat'l Medal of Science (Oct 8)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-08</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-trump-musk-national-medal-science-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/president-trump-presents-national-medals-of-science-and-national-medals-of-technology-and-innovation/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: White House release (Oct 8 2026): at the Science: A New Golden Age Summit, President Trump presented the National Medal of Science to Elon Musk, with Sergey Brin, Jensen Huang and Lisa Su; Michael Dell and Satya Nadella received the National Medal of Technology and Innovation. Context on the map: Musk is a current co-director of the Department of War's Project Meridian study and SpaceX is a major federal contractor. Honor and contracts sit side by side in time; no causation claimed.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-netanyahu-endorsement-2026" source="n0" target="n119"><data key="e_n">247</data><data key="e_id">trump-netanyahu-endorsement-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">political endorsement (Truth Social letter, Israel's Oct 27 2026 election)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">'Complete and Total Endorsement' (Oct 18)</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-15 (Newsmax: not getting involved) ; 2026-10-18 (endorsement) ; 2026-10-19 (call video)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-trump-netanyahu-endorsement-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">5</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.timesofisrael.com/liveblog_entry/trump-gives-warrior-netanyahu-complete-and-total-endorsement-for-reelection/ ; https://nypost.com/2026/10/18/us-news/trump-endorses-netanyahu-ahead-of-israels-elections/ ; https://www.jpost.com/israel-election-2026/article-912080 ; https://x.com/netanyahu/status/2112221725379514437 ; https://www.politico.com/news/2026/10/19/jd-vance-declines-to-endorse-netanyahu-for-reelection-01127435</data><data key="e_claim">SAID by Trump (Truth Social letter 'To the Great People of Israel', Oct 18 2026): his 'Complete and Total Endorsement' of Netanyahu for re-election; 'If Israel has the wrong Leader, which would be anyone other than Bibi, America will have to do this work ourselves, and I am not inclined to do so'; Iran 'unless they change their ways, rapidly, we will soon finish the job' (conditional; no operation DONE). Sequence: Oct 15 Newsmax, Trump said he was not getting involved; Oct 18 endorsed; Oct 19 Netanyahu posted a 91-second video of the call ('we have a job to finish'). Oct 19 VP Vance SAID 'I'm not getting involved in Israeli elections' (Politico/Reuters), splitting from the President a day later.</data></edge>
<edge id="ellison-musk-twitter-equity-1b" source="n57" target="n32"><data key="e_n">248</data><data key="e_id">ellison-musk-twitter-equity-1b</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (equity commitment $1B, Twitter buyout; Lawrence J. Ellison Revocable Trust)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$1B Twitter equity (2022)</data><data key="e_date">2022-05-05 (SC 13D/A) ; 2026-10-17 (TikTok suspends 'Musk' film ad account)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-ellison-musk-twitter-equity-1b</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1418091/000110465922056055/tm2214608-1_sc13da.htm ; https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/politics-news/musk-movie-tiktok-banned-theaters-showtimes-1236734308/ ; https://www.theverge.com/tech/1013453/tiktok-bans-alex-gibneys-musk-documentary</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (SEC SC 13D/A filed by Elon Musk re Twitter, May 5 2022): 'Lawrence J. Ellison Revocable Trust $1,000,000,000', the largest listed co-investor equity commitment. Later, separate: on Oct 17 2026 TikTok, in which Oracle holds 15% of the US JV, suspended the paid advertising account for Alex Gibney's documentary 'Musk', in which Ellison appears (THR; the non-paid account stayed visible per THR). Both facts are DONE; any motive linking them is not shown. Whether each May 2022 commitment funded at the Oct 2022 close is a hole.</data></edge>
<edge id="binance-musk-twitter-equity-500m" source="n219" target="n32"><data key="e_n">249</data><data key="e_id">binance-musk-twitter-equity-500m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (equity commitment $500M, Twitter buyout)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$500M Twitter equity (2022)</data><data key="e_date">2022-05-05 (SC 13D/A) ; CZ pardon 2025-10-21</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-binance-musk-twitter-equity-500m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1418091/000110465922056055/tm2214608-1_sc13da.htm ; https://www.justice.gov/pardon/clemency-grants-president-donald-j-trump-2025-present</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (SEC SC 13D/A, May 5 2022): Binance committed $500,000,000 of equity to Musk's Twitter buyout. Separately DONE: Trump pardoned Binance founder Changpeng Zhao on Oct 21 2025 (DOJ Pardon Attorney list), after the MGX/Binance USD1 deal with World Liberty Financial already on the map. Funding 2022 ... pardon 2025 is a sequence; no causation claimed.</data></edge>
<edge id="qatar-holding-musk-twitter-equity-375m" source="n220" target="n32"><data key="e_n">250</data><data key="e_id">qatar-holding-musk-twitter-equity-375m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (equity commitment $375M, Twitter buyout)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$375M Twitter equity (2022)</data><data key="e_date">2022-05-05 (SC 13D/A)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-qatar-holding-musk-twitter-equity-375m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1418091/000110465922056055/tm2214608-1_sc13da.htm</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (SEC SC 13D/A, May 5 2022): Qatar Holding LLC, the Qatar Investment Authority's investment arm, committed $375,000,000 of equity to Musk's Twitter buyout. Qatari state money also appears on the map in the Skydance/CNN-CBS financing (PIF/QIA/L'IMAD). Whether the commitment funded at the Oct 2022 close is a hole.</data></edge>
<edge id="witkoff-capital-musk-twitter-equity-100m" source="n6" target="n32"><data key="e_n">251</data><data key="e_id">witkoff-capital-musk-twitter-equity-100m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (Witkoff Capital equity commitment $100M, Twitter buyout)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">Witkoff Capital $100M (2022)</data><data key="e_date">2022-05-05 (SC 13D/A) ; envoy 2025-</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-witkoff-capital-musk-twitter-equity-100m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1418091/000110465922056055/tm2214608-1_sc13da.htm ; https://slate.com/technology/2022/05/elon-musks-twitter-investors-a-guide-to-whos-who.html</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (SEC SC 13D/A, May 5 2022): Witkoff Capital committed $100,000,000 of equity to Musk's Twitter buyout; Slate's 2022 investor guide identifies Witkoff Capital as Steve Witkoff's firm. Witkoff later became Trump's special envoy (2025-). Same filing lists Ellison $1B, Binance $500M and Qatar Holding $375M. Whether the commitment funded at the Oct 2022 close is a hole.</data></edge>
<edge id="doe-williams-constitution-pipeline-dpa-42m" source="n221" target="n222"><data key="e_n">252</data><data key="e_id">doe-williams-constitution-pipeline-dpa-42m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">government funding (Defense Production Act Title III, up to $42M)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">DPA Title III up to $42M</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-doe-williams-constitution-pipeline-dpa-42m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.energy.gov/articles/energy-department-advances-constitution-pipeline-project-42-million-defense-production-act ; https://www.energy.gov/hgeo/defense-production-act-title-iii-constitution-pipeline-project</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: DOE announced (Oct 19 2026) up to $42M in DPA Title III funds for Williams' 125-mile Constitution Pipeline (Susquehanna Co. PA to Schoharie Co. NY), for pre-construction and permitting work, under Presidential Determination No. 2026-12 (gas pipelines essential to national defense), from $1B appropriated under the 'Working Families Tax Cut'. SAID: Wright says construction could start 'next spring', service by winter 2028. NOT DONE: no permits; FERC's earlier authorizations were vacated after the 2nd Circuit and the proceedings dismissed (FERC May 19 2026); NY DEC opposed. A defense-emergency label is SAID; the money is DONE.</data></edge>
<edge id="puzder-spacex-eu-spectrum-threat" source="n223" target="n33"><data key="e_n">253</data><data key="e_id">puzder-spacex-eu-spectrum-threat</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">official advocacy (SAID: 'devastating' retaliation if EU restricts 2 GHz spectrum for US firms incl. SpaceX/Starlink)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">threatens EU over Starlink spectrum</data><data key="e_date">2026-10-18</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-puzder-spacex-eu-spectrum-threat</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.ft.com/content/d1e28d93-8574-4a46-946a-b261c401d6fa ; https://www.aa.com.tr/en/americas/us-warns-eu-of-devastating-retaliation-over-satellite-spectrum-plans/4092940</data><data key="e_claim">SAID by US Ambassador to the EU Andrew Puzder (FT, Oct 18 2026; AA): European firms could face 'devastating' US retaliation if Brussels reserves most of the 2 GHz direct-to-device band for European operators, cutting access for US firms including SpaceX/Starlink and Amazon. No retaliation DONE; the EU plan is not yet law. Same week: Rubio SAID (Oct 17) 'nobody ordered' the Starlink slowdown in Ukraine and Starshield is 'not at this moment available to Ukraine'. A US ambassador is acting as the voice of a contractor whose CEO co-directs a Pentagon study; no payment or instruction shown.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-john-g-trump-uncle-tesla-1943" source="n0" target="n224"><data key="e_n">254</data><data key="e_id">trump-john-g-trump-uncle-tesla-1943</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">family (paternal uncle)</data><data key="e_category">family</data><data key="e_label">uncle; 1943 Tesla papers assessor</data><data key="e_date">1907-1985 ; Tesla papers report 1943-01-30</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-trump-john-g-trump-uncle-tesla-1943</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://physicstoday.aip.org/news/a-profile-of-john-trump-donalds-oft-mentioned-scientist-uncle ; https://vault.fbi.gov/nikola-tesla/Nikola%20Tesla%20Part%2001/view ; https://www.nsf.gov/honorary-awards/national-medal-science/recipients/john-g-trump</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: John G. Trump (1907-1985) was the President's paternal uncle (Physics Today; NYT obituary 1985). He was secretary of the NDRC Microwave Committee/Division 14 (radar) and NDRC liaison to the MIT Rad Lab. FBI Vault Tesla file Part 01: his two-page report of Jan 30 1943 to Walter Gorsuch (Office of Alien Property), signed 'Technical Aide, Division 14, NDRC', judged Tesla's papers of no significant value. That verdict is SAID by a sole assessor inside the wartime research establishment, written while the 1940-42 invention-secrecy law was in force; no independent check of the papers was found. National Medal of Science (1983 citation, presented posthumously by Reagan 1985).</data></edge>
<edge id="drc-finance-txat-17-6m-wire" source="n225" target="n218"><data key="e_n">255</data><data key="e_id">drc-finance-txat-17-6m-wire</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (wire $17.6M, 2025-05-29; per an unnamed WH official's reading of the wire record)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$17.6M wire (I, SAID)</data><data key="e_date">2025-05-03 (alleged Grenell text) ; 2025-05-29 (wire) ; 2026-10-19 (Axios)</data><data key="e_grade">I</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-I-drc-finance-txat-17-6m-wire</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.axios.com/2026/10/19/kennedy-center-text-trump-grenell-habba ; https://www.axios.com/2026/10/14/trump-kennedy-center-donation-maga-feud</data><data key="e_claim">SAID (Axios, Oct 19 2026): an unnamed White House official says the May 29 2025 wire record shows the $17.6M sent to Texas Armament &amp; Technology (Houston) came from Congo's 'Ministere des Finances', Kinshasa, not from Turhan Mildon's account ('We're trying to find out whose money this is'). SAID by Mildon via attorneys: he wired it at Grenell's direction, ~$5.6M meant for the Kennedy Center, which never got it. Axios reviewed a May 3 2025 text allegedly from Grenell: 'Once the money comes to the company here, I will arrange the donation to Kennedy Centre...'. Grenell SAID 'lies' and denies sending it. WH Counsel Will Scharf is reviewing (sources). Kennedy Center records show only a $270K Mildon pledge (Axios Oct 14). Graded I: the sender identity rests on one anonymous official; TX-AT, Congo and Mildon's lawyers did not confirm.</data></edge>
<edge id="alfozan-saudi-royal-contact" source="n226" target="n227"><data key="e_n">256</data><data key="e_id">alfozan-saudi-royal-contact</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">contact (frequent WhatsApp 2025-26; SAID by US prosecutors)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">WhatsApp contact (prosecutors' SAID)</data><data key="e_date">2025 - 2026-10-05 ; arrest 2026-10-09 ; memo 2026-10-18</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">SAID</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-alfozan-saudi-royal-contact</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/US-v-Alfozan-Memo-in-Support-of-Motion-for-Detention-10-18-26.pdf ; https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/19/openai-bugging-suspect-alfozan-saudi-royal-family.html</data><data key="e_claim">SAID by US prosecutors (N.D. Cal. detention memo, US v. Alfozan, 3:26-mj-71329, Dkt 12, Oct 18 2026): ex-OpenAI engineer Abdulrahman Alfozan was 'in frequent communication via WhatsApp with a member of the Saudi Royal Family' in 2025-26, as recently as Oct 5; that person pitched a Saudi AI initiative and wrote 'Saudi needs you more then the US!' (Alfozan: '100'). After his Oct 9 arrest his wife and son left on a one-way ticket 'booked and paid for by a Saudi military official'. DONE (CNBC Oct 19): held without bail. No espionage or foreign-agent charge filed; the royal is unnamed; Saudi government had not commented.</data></edge>
<edge id="alfozan-openai-employment" source="n226" target="n194"><data key="e_n">257</data><data key="e_id">alfozan-openai-employment</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">employment (ex-OpenAI engineer)</data><data key="e_category">employment</data><data key="e_label">ex-OpenAI engineer</data><data key="e_date">to 2026-10 ; arrest 2026-10-09</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-alfozan-openai-employment</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/19/openai-bugging-suspect-alfozan-saudi-royal-family.html ; https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/US-v-Alfozan-Memo-in-Support-of-Motion-for-Detention-10-18-26.pdf</data><data key="e_claim">DONE: Alfozan is a former OpenAI engineer charged after a hidden recording device was found (arrest Oct 9 2026), per the DOJ detention memo and CNBC (Oct 19 2026). Employment tie only; it links the Saudi-royal contact above to the frontier-lab node.</data></edge>
<edge id="shawn-ryan-anduril-investor" source="n228" target="n18"><data key="e_n">258</data><data key="e_id">shawn-ryan-anduril-investor</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">ownership (minority investor since Oct 2025; self-disclosed)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">investor (self-disclosed)</data><data key="e_date">2025-10 - present</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-shawn-ryan-anduril-investor</data><data key="e_source_tier">social</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://linkedin.com/in/shawn-ryan-84b97314a ; https://podcasts.apple.com/sr/podcast/my-unredacted-interview-with-the-leah-files/id1492492083?i=1000797160445</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (self-disclosed, LinkedIn): Shawn Ryan lists himself as an investor in Anduril Industries since Oct 2025 and Shield AI since Nov 2025. SAID by Ryan (Oct 19 2026 episode note): 'my investments, I've intentionally made them public ... I invest in Shield AI and Anduril'. Founders Fund (Thiel) and a16z are separate Anduril investors already on the map; a shared cap table is not a joint investment with Thiel personally. Leah Files' account that she was told not to name names is one party's SAID (UNVERIFIED).</data></edge>
<edge id="dow-oracle-enterprise-software-7b" source="n229" target="n57"><data key="e_n">259</data><data key="e_id">dow-oracle-enterprise-software-7b</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">government contract (Enterprise Software Agreement, up to 10 yrs, ~$7B; all DoW + Coast Guard + Intelligence Community)</data><data key="e_category">contract</data><data key="e_label">~$7B enterprise software (Jul 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-07-23</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-dow-oracle-enterprise-software-7b</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://dowcio.war.gov/In-the-News/Article/4554232/dow-awards-a-nearly-7-billion-oracle-agreement-to-accelerate-the-arsenal-of-fre/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (DoW CIO, Jul 23 2026): the Department of War awarded Oracle an Enterprise Software Agreement of up to 10 years, about $7B ($3.31B over the 5-year base, $6.99B with options), negotiated by the Navy, covering all of DoW plus the Coast Guard and the Intelligence Community. Oracle is chaired by Larry Ellison (alias on this map).</data></edge>
<edge id="ellison-fidf-16-6m-2017" source="n57" target="n230"><data key="e_n">260</data><data key="e_id">ellison-fidf-16-6m-2017</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (gift $16.6M; largest single gift in FIDF history)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$16.6M gift (2017)</data><data key="e_date">2017-11-02</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-19 (v15)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-19</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-19-powermap-v15-V-ellison-fidf-16-6m-2017</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.timesofisrael.com/record-53-8-million-raised-for-idf-soldiers-at-beverly-hills-gala/ ; https://www.jta.org/2017/11/05/united-states/record-53-8-million-raised-for-idf-soldiers-at-beverly-hills-gala</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (Times of Israel; JTA, Nov 2017): at the FIDF Western gala in Beverly Hills on Nov 2 2017, Larry Ellison gave $16.6M, the largest single gift in FIDF history, earmarked for well-being facilities on an IDF training campus. Claims of 'close personal ties to Netanyahu' are not graded here (not re-sourced).</data></edge>
<edge id="exim-mesabi-770m-loan" source="n231" target="n232"><data key="e_n">261</data><data key="e_id">exim-mesabi-770m-loan</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">government financing (EXIM board-approved $770M direct loan for the Nashwauk MN iron-ore mine; separate EXIM indication of support noted in claim)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$770M direct loan (2026-09)</data><data key="e_date">2026-09 (board approval, week before Sep 28)</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-exim-mesabi-770m-loan</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.exim.gov/news/exim-chairman-jovanovic-oval-office-it-all-starts-mining-more-america ; https://www.mesabimetallics.com/mesabi-metallics-monetizes-portion-of-royalty-interest-for-265-million/ ; https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (EXIM release, Sep 28 2026): EXIM's board approved a $770M direct loan for Mesabi Metallics' Minnesota iron-ore mine the week before the Oval Office event; Mesabi's Jun 1 2026 release says it also holds an EXIM 'indication of support' of up to $10B. The only other EXIM package near that size is a $10B critical-minerals reserve (Star Tribune). Other lenders: Breakwall Capital/Vitol $520M, Macquarie $150M.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-mesabi-oval-announcement-2026" source="n0" target="n232"><data key="e_n">262</data><data key="e_id">trump-mesabi-oval-announcement-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">presidential promotion (Oval Office announcement of Mesabi's Iowa steel mill, Sep 28 2026; no money from Trump)</data><data key="e_category">business</data><data key="e_label">Oval launch of Iowa mill (Sep 28 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-09-28</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">BOTH</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-trump-mesabi-oval-announcement-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">4</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://x.com/WhiteHouse/status/2104647442750951721 ; https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/28/trump-steel-plant-iowa.html ; https://governor.iowa.gov/press-release/2026-10-02/gov-reynolds-signs-legislative-amendments-mega-program-paving-way-historic-15-billion-steel-mill ; https://www.iowapublicradio.org/political-news/2026-10-02/state-lawmakers-special-session-tax-breaks-steel-plant</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (White House, Sep 28 2026): Trump announced Mesabi Metallics' 15-billion-dollar Lee County, Iowa steel plant from the Oval Office, flanked by Lutnick, Wright, EXIM chair Jovanovic and the Ruia family. SAID (Lutnick): 'this deal's done'; WH officials said it did not depend on local incentives. DONE next: Iowa called a special session the next day and Gov. Reynolds signed HF 2801 on Oct 2 (MEGA credit up to 10%); the preliminary state package shown to lawmakers is about USD 1.36B (SAID, Des Moines Register via IPR); the IEDA board has not approved a final contract.</data></edge>
<edge id="jason-miller-mesabi-lobbyist" source="n233" target="n232"><data key="e_n">263</data><data key="e_id">jason-miller-mesabi-lobbyist</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">lobbying (registered federal lobbyist via SHW Partners LLC; LDA reports list contacts at EXIM, the White House Office, Commerce, Energy, Treasury, Interior, USTR)</data><data key="e_category">contact</data><data key="e_label">registered lobbyist (SHW Partners) -&gt; EXIM/WH</data><data key="e_date">2025 - 2026</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-jason-miller-mesabi-lobbyist</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://lobbyingsoftware.com/filing/758253 ; https://lobbyingsoftware.com/filing/789871 ; https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (Senate/House LDA, SHW Partners LLC for client Mesabi Metallics Company LLC; Q3 2025 report filed Oct 20 2025): lobbyist Jason Miller; issues incl. Sections 232/301 trade actions; agencies contacted incl. EXIM Bank and the White House Office. Q4 2025 and Q2 2026 reports show $120,000 each. Star Tribune (Oct 17 2026): Miller lobbied for Mesabi shortly before rejoining the White House and two months before the Oval announcement. Lobbying, then WH job, then EXIM loan/Oval launch is a sequence; no cause claimed. Miller SAID he is 'proud' of bringing in the investment.</data></edge>
<edge id="trump-jason-miller-wh-adviser-2026" source="n0" target="n233"><data key="e_n">264</data><data key="e_id">trump-jason-miller-wh-adviser-2026</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">appointment (senior White House messaging adviser, special government employee per reports)</data><data key="e_category">appointment</data><data key="e_label">WH messaging adviser (Jul 2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-07 - present</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-trump-jason-miller-wh-adviser-2026</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.cnn.com/2026/07/01/politics/jason-miller-white-house-trump ; https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/06/29/former-trump-adviser-jason-miller-eyed-join-white-house-midterms-shake-up/</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (CNN Jul 1 2026; WaPo Jun 29): Jason Miller rejoined the White House in July 2026 in a senior messaging role for the midterms, described as a special government employee. He had been Mesabi Metallics' registered lobbyist (edge jason-miller-mesabi-lobbyist).</data></edge>
<edge id="tmcr-mesabi-royalty-265m" source="n234" target="n232"><data key="e_n">265</data><data key="e_id">tmcr-mesabi-royalty-265m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">financing / ownership (bought 50% of Mesabi's royalty interest for $265M, two $132.5M tranches; first closed Jun 1 2026)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$265M royalty purchase (2026)</data><data key="e_date">2026-06-01</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-tmcr-mesabi-royalty-265m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.mesabimetallics.com/mesabi-metallics-monetizes-portion-of-royalty-interest-for-265-million/ ; https://www.nasdaq.com/press-release/metals-royalty-company-announces-closing-additional-10-mesabi-royalty-and-us-165 ; https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (Mesabi Metallics release Jun 1 2026; TMCR closing release): TMCR agreed to buy 50% of Mesabi's royalty interest for $265M in two equal tranches; the first closed Jun 1 2026, and TMCR later closed an additional 1.0% royalty, taking its Mesabi interest to 2.0%. Star Tribune: TMCR has no revenue; its other major asset is a royalty on a seabed-mining company that owns 20% of TMCR.</data></edge>
<edge id="john-hess-tmcr-stake" source="n235" target="n234"><data key="e_n">266</data><data key="e_id">john-hess-tmcr-stake</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">ownership (John Hess 5% of TMCR common; son Michael Hess 5.2% and board co-chair, co-founder per an SEC filing)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">5% (+ son Michael 5.2%, co-chair)</data><data key="e_date">2026</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-john-hess-tmcr-stake</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">1</data><data key="e_single_source">True</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (SEC filings per Star Tribune, Oct 17 2026): John Hess owns 5% of TMCR's common stock and his son Michael Hess 5.2%; Michael is board co-chair and is listed as co-founder in one SEC filing. TMCR holds 2.0% of Mesabi's royalty. Star Tribune: Ivanka Trump and Jared Kushner reportedly attended Michael Hess's 2019 wedding (I, social). Trump SAID at a 2025 bill signing that John Hess is 'a friend of mine for a long time'. The Hess family did not respond.</data></edge>
<edge id="john-hess-maga-inc-1m" source="n235" target="n236"><data key="e_n">267</data><data key="e_id">john-hess-maga-inc-1m</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">funding (donation $1M, Dec 12 2025; plus $1M from his wife per Star Tribune; $1M to Trump's 2017 inauguration)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">$1M (Dec 2025)</data><data key="e_date">2025-12-12</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-john-hess-maga-inc-1m</data><data key="e_source_tier">primary</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">3</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://docquery.fec.gov/cgi-bin/fecimg/?202601029793901866 ; https://api.open.fec.gov/v1/schedules/schedule_a/?committee_id=C00892471&amp;contributor_name=hess&amp;min_amount=500000 ; https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (FEC Schedule A, MAGA Inc. C00892471): 'HESS, JOHN BRIDGE' $1,000,000 on 2025-12-12. Star Tribune (citing FEC): Hess and his wife each gave $1M to MAGA Inc. in December, and he gave $1M to Trump's 2017 inauguration fund. Donation, then TMCR/Mesabi, then EXIM loan and Oval launch is a sequence; the Star Tribune found no evidence that Trump or his family directly benefit.</data></edge>
<edge id="yorkville-tmcr-financing" source="n237" target="n234"><data key="e_n">268</data><data key="e_id">yorkville-tmcr-financing</data><data key="e_kind">register</data><data key="e_type">financing (commitment to buy up to $100M of TMCR common; affiliate joined the stock financing for the Mesabi royalty deal)</data><data key="e_category">funding</data><data key="e_label">up to $100M equity line</data><data key="e_date">2026</data><data key="e_grade">V</data><data key="e_saiddone">DONE</data><data key="e_sequence_only">False</data><data key="e_status">active</data><data key="e_status_date"></data><data key="e_added_in">2026-10-20 (v16)</data><data key="e_last_checked">2026-10-20</data><data key="e_register_row_id">grokbot-2026-10-20-powermap-v16-V-yorkville-tmcr-financing</data><data key="e_source_tier">press</data><data key="e_n_source_domains">2</data><data key="e_single_source">False</data><data key="e_sources">https://www.startribune.com/trump-allies-stand-to-gain-from-minnesota-ore-company-with-iowa-steel-dreams/601898816 ; https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/TMCR/6-k-metals-royalty-co-inc-current-report-foreign-issuer-bb45858a4e18.html</data><data key="e_claim">DONE (TMCR securities filings per Star Tribune Oct 17 2026; TMCR 6-K): Yorkville committed to buy up to $100M of TMCR common stock at a discount (the same structure it used with Trump Media), and a Yorkville affiliate joined a stock financing aimed at funding TMCR's Mesabi deal. Yorkville declined to comment.</data></edge>
